    {
      "text": "%spark\nimport scala.math.pow\nimport scala.math.log\nimport scala.math.sqrt\n\nval lambda \u003d 0.10\nval k_bid \u003d 0.2869152395076893\nval A_bid \u003d0.7749982203595104\nval k_ask \u003d 0.26629789524845365\nval A_ask \u003d0.7467809820187751\n\nval mu \u003d 5.307855605600286E-5\nval inventory \u003d 0\nval sigma \u003d 0.0033\n\n\nvar bid_spread \u003d (1f / lambda) * log(1f+lambda/k_bid) + ((-mu/(lambda*sigma*sigma))+(2f*inventory+1f)/2f)*sqrt(pow((1f+lambda/k_bid),(1f+k_bid/lambda))*(sigma*sigma*lambda)/(2f*k_bid*A_bid))\nbid_spread \u003d bid_spread.max(0.0)\nvar ask_spread \u003d (1f / lambda) * log(1f+lambda/k_ask) + ((mu/(lambda*sigma*sigma))-(2f*inventory-1f)/2f)*sqrt(pow((1f+lambda/k_ask),(1f+k_ask/lambda))*(sigma*sigma*lambda)/(2f*k_ask*A_ask))\nask_spread \u003d ask_spread.max(0.0)\n",
