    {
      "text": "%pyspark\nfrom math import log,sqrt\n\nk_bid \u003d 0.2869152395076893\nA_bid \u003d0.7749982203595104\nk_ask \u003d 0.26629789524845365\nA_ask \u003d0.7467809820187751\n\nmu \u003d 5.307855605600286E-5\ninventory \u003d 0.2\nsigma \u003d 0.0033\n\n\nlda \u003d 0.001\n\n\ntest \u003d (1 / lda) * log(1+lda/k_bid) + ((-mu/(lda*sigma*sigma))+(2*inventory+1)/2)*sqrt(pow((1+lda/k_bid),(1+k_bid/lda))*(sigma*sigma*lda)/(2*k_bid*A_bid))\nprint(test)",
